  Vendor IDs lifted from rfid_scan_app/app/src/main/res/xml/device_filter.xml.
  These cover KC-series UHF UART/USB readers (CH340, CP210x, FT232, PL2303,
  WCH variants) used by the standalone scanner. Adding the same list here
  lets the DigiLog APK auto-launch when the reader is plugged in and gives
  it permission to open the USB endpoint.
-->
